00:00:31.690 --> 00:00:34.450
And then from 9:00 a.m., so basically,

00:00:34.450 --> 00:00:37.120
meetings from 8:00 a.m.
outside the office,

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:40.560
to nine, nine in the office,
til usually six or seven.

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:42.310
